    <item>
      <title>沃什考虑减少美联储政策会议的频率</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/business/federal-reserve-warsh-meetings.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[几十年来，美联储每年至少召开八次会议。减少会议次数将是凯文·M·沃什(Kevin M. Warsh)担任董事长以来最大的改变。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/business/federal-reserve-warsh-meetings.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 21:11:16 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>托德·布兰奇对特朗普的忠诚使他的司法部长确认面临风险</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/todd-blanche-ag-trump-immunity.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[托德·布兰奇的做法与参议院由两人组成的陪审团现实相冲突，迄今为止，这种现实使他无法获得他梦寐以求的奖项：参议院确认所赋予的稳定和地位。]]></description>
      <guid>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/us/politics/todd-blanche-ag-trump-immunity.html</guid>
      <pubDate>Fri, 31 Jul 2026 21:02:54 GMT</pubDate>
    </item>
    <item>
      <title>特朗普领导下的公司纷纷完成大胆交易</title>
      <link>https://www.nytimes.com/2026/07/31/business/corporate-mergers-deals-trump.html</link>
      <description><![CDATA[许多公司正在抓住可能是多年来对企业最有利的监管环境。]]></description>
